Caesar’s Hospital
- Get Admitted Into the Hospital
	Would you like to spend $200 to fully restore your resolve?
	- Yes
		if {Global.player_money} >= 200:
			do Global.set_resolve_to_max()
			set {Global.player_money} -= 200
			You have been fully healed
			do Global.use_action()
		else:
			You don't have enough money
	- No
- Pretend to Be a Nurse (Requires Disguise) | [if {catalytic_found_hospital} == false] [else="hide"]
	if {Inventory.has_item("Disguise")}:
		You sneak into the hospital with a doctor disguise. You open the first door you see and it's a closet with a catalytic converter.
		do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
		set {catalytic_found_hospital} = true
		do Global.use_action()
	else:
		You don't have a disguise
- Sleep
	You stumble into the hospital waiting room and pretend you're waiting for a patient. You fall asleep in the waiting room.
	do Global.sleep()